Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:10.22,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}I think it's time to blow this scene
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.22,0:00:12.50,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}Get everybody and their stuff together
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:14.99,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,0)}Okay, three, two, one let's jam
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.99,0:03:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.40,0:03:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I have come to take your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.80,0:04:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.33,0:06:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Your partner sure is unlucky, Jet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.68,0:06:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he wasn't all that lucky to begin with...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.17,0:06:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This case is especially bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.71,0:06:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be better to not get\Nyourselves involved in this one. {extra lead-out. Original: "It would"}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.91,0:06:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care, just answer me. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.47,0:06:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you this for your own sake, and
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.38,0:06:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,if you get too involved in this,\NI'm gonna get in trouble, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.81,0:06:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Bob...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.95,0:07:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the only person\NI can rely on right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.05,0:07:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure it won't be bad for you. So...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.65,0:07:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you say that every time?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.11,0:07:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Really... you always have been a guy\Nthat likes to get into trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.06,0:07:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, this is only a rumor, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.17,0:07:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you heard of the name "Mad Pierrot"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.05,0:07:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is... the rumored mummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.10,0:07:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I heard you got beaten up\Nby some weird guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.24,0:07:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I recall you were sleeping\Nlike this once before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.44,0:07:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You really haven't shown\Nany improvement...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.35,0:07:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well, it doesn't have\Nanything to do with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.36,0:07:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you end up in situations\Nlike that because you never behave?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.05,0:08:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I have nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.21,0:08:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So, since I have nothing to\Ndo with it, if you'll excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.20,0:08:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.37,0:08:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The victim was a high-ranking\Nguy from the ISSP.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.32,0:08:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He was the seventh victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.77,0:08:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.26,0:08:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't blame ya. This is top-secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.08,0:08:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently those higher-ups don't\Nwant the world to find out about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.83,0:08:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.99,0:08:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Your partner is in deep trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.66,0:08:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy is a perfect killing machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.84,0:08:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,They say that nobody who has seen\Nhis face has made it out alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.84,0:08:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Even those lucky enough to escape'll be\Ntracked down to the ends of the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.63,0:08:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and they always wind up dead. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.75,0:08:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They say he appears with a smile,\Nand he leaves with a smile...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.63,0:09:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he is the mysterious\Nassassin known as Mad Pierrot...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.49,0:09:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Tongpu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.55,0:10:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Faye-Faye!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.87,0:10:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Puff, puff! Faye-Faye!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.48,0:10:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Puff, puff! Faye-Faye...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.04,0:10:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey you, can you stop saying\Nmy name twice like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.48,0:10:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Faye-Faye, a weird mail came, came.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.28,0:10:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.97,0:10:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And I woulda been done if\NI had a little more time... {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.09,0:10:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't read it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.43,0:10:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,"Hello, boy. I invite you\Nto a wonderful party..."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.05,0:10:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.22,0:10:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, keep the fact that this\Nmail came a secret from Spike.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.14,0:10:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.60,0:10:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.56,0:10:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.94,0:10:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't, that idiot... {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.63,0:10:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,...will run out to meet him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.91,0:10:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a secret, secret mail!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.83,0:10:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Space Land?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.79,0:10:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty considerate of him\Nto hold the party there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.12,0:10:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna go like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.92,0:10:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it would be perfect\Nif it was a masquerade.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.45,0:11:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe this one really\Nwill be the end of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.60,0:11:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kidding! Would you come\Nrescue me if I said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.70,0:11:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.77,0:11:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot, idiot, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.84,0:11:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.98,0:11:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, it's you, Ed. Where's Spike?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.75,0:11:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He went somewhere.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.27,0:11:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.50,0:11:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that this is anything new... That idiot...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.09,0:11:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot, idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.72,0:11:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ed, I have a favor to ask.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.43,0:11:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.27,0:13:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.21,0:13:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.79,0:13:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.81,0:13:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's party!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.66,0:13:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You can't enter here!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.60,0:13:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's dangerous in here! Let's play outside!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.77,0:13:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's dangerous in here! Let's play outside!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.45,0:13:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.27,0:13:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's dangerous in here! Let's play outside!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.91,0:13:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's dangerous in here!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.28,0:14:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's dangerous in here! Let's play outside!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.33,0:14:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.75,0:14:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All right, Ed...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.86,0:14:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}First, enter the ISSP's main computer,\Nand look for section 13.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.96,0:14:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye, aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.80,0:14:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the section that doesn't\Nexist to the general public.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.19,0:14:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's a pretty tall order... Can you do it?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.80,0:14:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.80,0:15:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.73,0:15:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.24,0:15:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}After you open it, find the file\Nwith the code name "Tongpu."{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.57,0:15:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.37,0:16:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Peek-a
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.95,0:16:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.95,0:17:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}ISSP Assassination Ability{\i0}\N{\i1}Improvement Experiment.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.83,0:17:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Experiment sample chart number 46.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.00,0:17:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Code name: Tongpu.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.14,0:18:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Confirmed a strong regression{\i0}\N{\i1}of the mind during the experiment.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.52,0:18:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Experiment was canceled.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.81,0:18:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sample to be permanently kept{\i0}\N{\i1}in a quarantine facility.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.77,0:18:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,In the beginning, he escaped\Nfrom the facilities to seek revenge,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.34,0:18:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,but now he seems to be enjoying\Nthe actual act of killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.02,0:18:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,His mind must be continuing to regress.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.43,0:18:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So, he's like a child with\Nsuperhuman fighting abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.19,0:18:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Really...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.04,0:18:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There is nothing as pure\Nand cruel as children.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.40,0:19:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's show time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.26,0:19:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That was unnecessary!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.33,0:19:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hello, hello...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.94,0:19:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hello! Hello!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.38,0:19:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.12,0:21:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.95,0:21:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.77,0:21:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.01,0:21:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.63,0:21:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurts...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.82,0:21:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy, it hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.40,0:21:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.83,0:21:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts... Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.32,0:22:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Spike! All right,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.79,0:22:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}we figured out what he is! He's—{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.83,0:22:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.35,0:22:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need it anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.99,0:22:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It all ended just now...
