Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.18,0:24:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew there was something\Nfishy going on lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.18,0:24:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So, that's what it was!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.48,0:24:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? What are you guys talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.02,0:24:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You really can't judge\Npeople by their looks...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.60,0:24:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.10,0:24:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, what are you\Nguys talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.04,0:24:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought it would\Nbe a teenage girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.35,0:24:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes me despise him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.28,0:24:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.23,0:24:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Next episode: Boogie Woogie Feng Shui.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.32,0:24:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything!
